---
pagination:
  data: catalog.lessons
  size: 1
  alias: lesson
permalink: "{{ lesson.url }}"
layout: layouts/base.njk
eleventyComputed:
  title: "北师大版{{ lesson.grade | cn }}年级数学{{ lesson.volumeName }}《{{ lesson.title }}》教学内容介绍"
  description: "北师大版{{ lesson.grade | cn }}年级{{ lesson.volumeName }}《{{ lesson.title }}》备课参考：{{ lesson.focus }}"
---
<nav class="crumb" aria-label="面包屑"><a href="/">首页</a> / <a href="/textbooks/bsd/">北师大版</a> / <a href="{{ lesson.bookUrl }}">{{ lesson.grade | cn }}年级{{ lesson.volumeName }}</a> / <a href="{{ lesson.unitUrl }}">{{ lesson.unitTitle }}</a> / {{ lesson.title }}</nav>
<article class="lesson-content">
<header class="intro"><p class="eyebrow">课时导航 · {{ lesson.revision }}</p><h1>《{{ lesson.title }}》教学内容介绍</h1><p class="lead">这节课属于北师大版{{ lesson.grade | cn }}年级数学{{ lesson.volumeName }}“{{ lesson.unitTitle }}”单元，建议从学生已有经验与具体情境出发理解数学概念。</p></header>
<section><h2>本课所在单元的核心目标</h2><p>{{ lesson.focus }}</p></section>
<section><h2>课堂教学如何组织？</h2><p>围绕《{{ lesson.title }}》的课题情境，引导学生先提出数学问题，再尝试用实物、示意图或算式表达自己的思考。{{ lesson.activity }}</p></section>
<section><h2>备课时值得关注的易错点</h2><p>{{ lesson.pitfall }}</p><p>可以让学生在解释方法时指出每个数字、图形元素或计量单位的含义，避免只凭记忆给出结果。</p></section>
{% if lesson.html %}<section class="original-note"><h2>本讲原创教学设计与课件说明</h2>{{ lesson.html | safe }}</section>{% endif %}
<section class="cta"><h2>《{{ lesson.title }}》互动课件</h2>
<p>想看这节课的动画演示和课堂互动设计？十一课件的原创互动课件在小红书主页持续更新。</p>
{% if lesson.videoUrl %}<p><a class="button secondary" href="{{ lesson.videoUrl }}">查看互动演示</a></p>{% endif %}
<a class="button" href="{{ lesson.shopUrl if lesson.shopUrl else site.social.xiaohongshu }}" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">去小红书看课件 ↗</a></section>
</article>
